<title>USA: Apple South Inc Q3 net shr falls.</title>
<headline>Apple South Inc Q3 net shr falls.</headline>
<dateline>MADISON, Ga. 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.03		    $0.16</p>
<p> Net			  1,188		    6,474</p>
<p> Sales		    139,796		  118,992</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  39,147		   40,079</p>
<p>	  Nine months</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.14		    $0.50</p>
<p> Net			  5,477		   19,287</p>
<p> Sales		    403,074		  318,187</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  39,625		   38,301</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Current third quarter figure includes a $4.7 million or $0.12 per share after-tax charge for the closing of six remaining Tomato Rumba's and dissolution of the division.  </p>
<p>Operating earnings before the charge were $0.15.</p>
<p>1995 third quarter operating earnings include a $1.3 million or $0.03 per share after-tax charge predominantly related to the merger with DF&amp;R Restaurants Inc.</p>
<p>1996 nine-month figures reflect $17.4 million or $0.44 per share in after-tax charges for writedowns in the first and third quarters.</p>
</text>
